    "homeType": "MULTI_FAMILY",
    "description": "Magnificent Mission Terrace Maisons. 2 homes on one lot.  Opportunity abounds with these two (2!) Mission terrace homes on one lot with a shared outdoor space and vacant lot next door.  Originally built in the early 1900s these two homes exude period details throughout and are perfect for a family looking to update and use both homes and/ or a development opportunity.  Don't miss this chance to own a part of Old Mission terrace history and start your own family history in this stellar location.  Mission Terrace is a special neighborhood, family-friendly and community-oriented; nestled below Glen Park Station, the area features Gus's community market, public library, and a variety of shops. Both homes sit on the end of a cul-de-sac, easy for walking (91 walk-score), bike riding, and quick access to local dining, cafes, shopping, freeways, and superb public transportation.  Featuring a large 7,500 square foot lot, dont miss out on these two homes.  200 Cayuga features 3 beds and 2 baths and 84 Lamartine is a 2 bedroom/2 bath.  Both homes are on one lot."
  },
